---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="The Garden | Himaya Garden Tucson"
    description="Explore the quiet beauty of Himaya Garden in Tucson — a warm, layered outdoor sanctuary for weddings, tea gatherings, retreats, and meaningful celebrations."
>
    <main class="bg-cream text-charcoal">
        <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute inset-0">
                <img
                    src="/media/img/AG1_4.jpg"
                    alt="The serene garden at Himaya Garden"
                    class="h-full w-full object-cover"
                />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-charcoal/50"></div>
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-charcoal/60 via-charcoal/40 to-cream/80"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-20 pt-32 md:px-12 md:pt-40 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="max-w-3xl text-white">
                    <p class="mb-6 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-white/80">The Garden</p>
                    <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl font-light leading-none text-white md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
                        A desert sanctuary for meaningful gatherings.
                    </h1>
                    <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/80 md:text-lg">
                        Himaya Garden is a warm, beautifully layered space in Tucson where the rhythm slows down,
                        the light settles in, and every gathering feels rooted in care, beauty, and connection.
                    </p>

                    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary bg-sage hover:bg-white hover:text-charcoal border border-sage">
                            Book a Garden Tour
                        </a>
                        <a href="/private-events" class="btn-secondary border-white bg-transparent text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-charcoal">
                            Explore Events
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 border-t border-white/20 pt-8 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-white font-light">Intimate</div>
                        <div class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/70">Thoughtful settings</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-white font-light">Seasonal</div>
                        <div class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/70">Natural beauty</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-white font-light">Welcoming</div>
                        <div class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/70">Filipino hospitality</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-cream">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label">A place to settle in</p>
                        <h2 class="section-heading mb-6 text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
                            Designed for slow moments and beautiful gatherings.
                        </h2>
                        <p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            The garden is more than a venue. It is a setting for connection — whether you are hosting a
                            wedding, a tea gathering, a private dinner, or an intimate group experience.
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-stone/80">
                            Every corner is shaped with intention: soft texture, warm natural tones, layered greenery, and a
                            light that feels quietly cinematic at golden hour. The result is a space that feels both elevated and deeply personal.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm shadow-sm sm:col-span-2">
                            <img src="/media/img/hero-image.webp" alt="Himaya Garden event setting" class="h-[320px] w-full object-cover" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm shadow-sm">
                            <img src="/media/img/aug-high-tea-banner.jpg" alt="Tea gathering in the garden" class="h-[220px] w-full object-cover" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm shadow-sm">
                            <img src="/media/img/collage-3_7.webp" alt="Garden dining experience" class="h-[220px] w-full object-cover" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="mb-14 text-center">
                    <p class="section-label">What makes it feel like Himaya</p>
                    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-light text-charcoal md:text-5xl">The atmosphere is part of the experience.</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <div class="rounded-sm border border-sage/10 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
                        <div class="mb-6 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sage/5 text-2xl">🌿</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl font-light text-charcoal">Soft desert light</h3>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            The garden is alive with warmth, texture, and a gentle golden glow that makes every moment feel cinematic and intimate.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-sm border border-sage/10 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
                        <div class="mb-6 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sage/5 text-2xl">✨</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl font-light text-charcoal">Layered spaces</h3>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            From open-air gathering areas to intimate corners, the grounds are designed to flex with the mood of each event.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rounded-sm border border-sage/10 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
                        <div class="mb-6 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sage/5 text-2xl">🤍</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl font-light text-charcoal">Warm hospitality</h3>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            Our approach is gracious and personal — guests feel looked after, comfortable, and genuinely welcomed from the start.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-cream">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="mb-12 text-center">
                    <p class="section-label">Gather in a few different ways</p>
                    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-light text-charcoal md:text-5xl">A setting for the moments that matter most.</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <a href="/weddings" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
                        <div class="overflow-hidden">
                            <img src="/media/img/celebration.png" alt="Wedding celebration at Himaya Garden" class="h-72 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-8">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sage">Weddings</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-light text-charcoal">Celebrate beautifully</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone">
                                Thoughtful, intimate, and naturally elevated for ceremonies and receptions that feel personal.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/private-events" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
                        <div class="overflow-hidden">
                            <img src="/media/img/high tea two women eating at the table.jpeg" alt="High Tea gathering at Himaya Garden" class="h-72 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-8">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sage">Tea & gatherings</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-light text-charcoal">Share a slower ritual</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone">
                                High tea, thoughtful menus, and intimate gatherings that invite guests to linger longer.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/events" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-white shadow-sm transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
                        <div class="overflow-hidden">
                            <img src="/media/img/collage-2.webp" alt="Retreat and workshop gathering at Himaya Garden" class="h-72 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-8">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sage">Retreats</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-light text-charcoal">Create space to reconnect</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone">
                                Retreats, workshops, and community-centered experiences that feel grounding and beautifully led.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="rounded-sm bg-white p-9 shadow-lg md:p-12">
                    <p class="section-label">The feeling</p>
                    <blockquote class="font-serif text-3xl leading-tight text-charcoal md:text-5xl">
                        “There is a kind of peace at Himaya Garden that makes people feel more present — and more connected to one another.”
                    </blockquote>
                    <div class="mt-8 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-stone/60">Himaya Garden experience</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-cream">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <p class="section-label">Let’s begin</p>
                    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-light text-charcoal md:text-5xl">
                        Visit the garden and imagine your next gathering here.
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                        Whether you are planning a wedding weekend, a private dinner, or a meaningful event in Tucson,
                        we would love to help shape it with warmth and intention.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
                        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Tour</a>
                        <a href="/private-events" class="btn-secondary">Request details</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>